SEL: relay part numbers (``PARTNO`` and ``PART NUM``) are decoded into the ordering options they encode (firmware, I/O cards per slot, Ethernet ports, protocols, ...) for the SEL-351, 351S, 351A, 311C, 751, 751A, 710, 787, 2411, 2440, and 2032, using the codes from SEL's public Model Option Tables (``peat.modules.sel.sel_partno``). The advisory result is saved in ``extra.part_number_info``, and a warning is logged if the part number and the firmware ID name different models.
